  "details": "# Issue:\n\nCurrently we can only export paths using the UI but not import them. To import a path we currently need to use OSC.\n\nOnly being able to use OSC feels weird, why would a camera operator be required to use an OSC tool just to import a path? This feels like a weird limitation to me.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nWe should be able to import paths from the UI to make it easier to save and share our paths.",
